Fri Oct 30 20:03:18 UTC 2026 - Tomáš Chvátal <tomas.chvatal@gmail.com>

- Set Version to 20261030.
- Add wl-clipboard Recommends: clipboard tools are a basic Wayland session
  utility, missing from the pattern.
- Drop the Leap 15 PulseAudio fallback in the audio section; pipewire-pulseaudio
  is now recommended unconditionally.
- Drop the dead suse_version above 1500 guard in the sway pattern: every live
  build target evaluates it true (Tumbleweed 1699, Leap 16 family 1600); Leap
  15.6 is EOL and no longer a devel target.
- Fix duplicate pattern-order 1460: sway moves to 1470.
- Format with spec-cleaner 1.3.1: drop the Group tags, add SECTION labels, fold
  the Clipboard comment into its marker, and sort the audio SECTION Recommends
  in full mode (pipewire-pulseaudio before pulseaudio-utils).

